<title>CANADA: Goldfarb Corp Q3 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Goldfarb Corp Q3 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.57		   C$0.60</p>
<p> Net			  3,526		    3,124</p>
<p> Revs		     271,882		   59,261</p>
<p>	    9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$1.24		   C$1.16</p>
<p> Net			  7,590		    6,094</p>
<p> Revs		     599,089		  116,102</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,630		    4,825</p>
<p>		(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Basic earnings per share for the third quarter were C$0.59 versus C$0.65 in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Third quarter profits are after the C$0.33 per share impact of a debt refinancing charge.</p>
<p>Goldfarb said the increase in its revenues reflects the April 1 acquisition of a majority stake in Speedy Muffler King Inc.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
